entry.content:
get_match: description  +Matches with a page on our website (soccer, basketball, hockey, tennis, volleyball, handball, baseball, American football): summary, ready paragraphs on the match from our data (table places, form, meetings, season), with key_facts before kick-off and what_it_means after the result, summary_as_of when written; only until kick-off and once finished, English only (no lang). Quote them as facts; never add predictions.
get_match_briefing: description  -fr). +fr), and summary: the most important sentences as one paragraph in that language.
get_player: description  -profile: +profile with summary: ready paragraphs from our data (club, season numbers, form; English, no lang; summary_as_of; absent when not fresh or for a player under 18);
get_standings: description  -league; +league, with summary: ready paragraphs on the league from our data (the race at the top and bottom, form side, scoring, top scorer, champions; English, no lang; summary_as_of; absent when not fresh);
get_team: description  +summary (soccer, NBA, NHL, MLB, NFL teams): ready paragraphs from our data (table place and gaps, record, form, home and away, squad leaders, next opponent; English, no lang; not with squad, injuries or season_stats of a US team; summary_as_of; absent when not fresh);
get_team_briefing: description  -fr). +fr), and summary: the most important ones as one paragraph.
